<title>USA: Global Marine Inc Q4 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Global Marine Inc Q4 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.23		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net			110,200		   13,600</p>
<p> Revs		     219,900		  113,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 175,500		  165,800</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.65		    $0.31</p>
<p> Net			110,100		   51,900</p>
<p> Revs		     680,700		  468,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 169,800		  165,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 and year exclude a credit to deferred income taxes of $70 million, or $0.40 a share. Including the deferred tax credit, net was $110.2 million, or $0.63 a share.</p>
<p>1995 year includes after tax gain of $14.3 million, or $0.08 a share, on sale of a drilling rig.</p>
</text>
